# hermetica-synthetix/ is a Node/React app living in this repo — the ML-repo
# patterns above (*.json, *.html, .*) are far too broad for it (they'd
# silently drop package.json, tsconfig.json, index.html, etc). Carve it out;
# hermetica-synthetix/.gitignore still handles its own real ignores
# (node_modules, dist, .env, uploads).
!hermetica-synthetix/**/*.json
!hermetica-synthetix/**/*.html
!hermetica-synthetix/**/.*
!hermetica-synthetix/.*